Looking back, there are a few lessons I’ll carry forward into all future projects. Foremost among them is the importance of maintaining a deep and continuous presence of the user throughout every phase of the design process – something that, after all, lies at the very core of human-centered design.

If someone were to use Forvo after this redesign, I'd hope they found a tool that enables their learning journey however they see fit — whatever their reasons for studying. And for native speakers, a place to share not just their language, but their culture in its genuine form, for everyone else to discover.
